er now or shortly depending on my  colleagues in the united states  this repository is also where you can  file issues  when you file issues these issues should  be focused to swift crypto if you need  to provide feedback about cryptokit  itself please continue to use the  feedback process that you use today  if you want to suggest new api you can  also do that on github we have a  template for api proposals please read  it and please use it if you want to file  new api proposals  if you want to provide an implementation  of your new api proposal please do so as  with all open source projects and as we  heard with erica as with swift  all issues and suggestions for  improvement are better if they have  accompanying code they are much more  likely to be accepted  otherwise  please use swift crypto  please discuss it on the swift forums  reach out with feedback from using it  tell us if you find limitations or if  things are awkward or unhelpful we would  love to know what you're using it for  what limitations you find and any of  your other thoughts  we are very very excited to see what  you're going to do with this brand new  library if there's anything you'd like  to chat about please find me after the  session on twitter or the swift forums  and on behalf of absolutely everybody  involved with swift crypto we are so  pleased to be able to share our work  with you today thank you very much

